data_nbs2
# Phase identity: cxr-mc crystal catalog entry [nbs2].
# Deterministic full-basis P1 export of crystal_structures.toml.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Metallic 2H-a NbS2, P6_3/mmc: Nb occupies aligned 2b columns and S occupies
# 4f with z=0.113. El Youbi et al., Phys. Rev. B 103, 155105 (2021), supplement,
# report supplier a=3.32, c=11.97 and adopt z=0.113 from Heil, Schlipf, and
# Giustino, Phys. Rev. B 98, 075120 (2018). The 2b/4f expansion is cross-checked
# against AFLOW AB2_hP6_194_b_f-002. Assumes a stoichiometric, unmodulated bulk
# cell. Limiting checks: two Nb + four S, V=(sqrt(3)/2)a^2c, and Nb(x,y) remains
# aligned across z=1/4 and 3/4. Validation: nbs2-2ha-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 3.32
_cell_length_b 3.32
_cell_length_c 11.97
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
